<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-GUYANA 95-4 V INDIA (341) - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GUYANA 95-4 V INDIA (341) - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guyana were 95-4 in reply to India's first innings of 341 all out at tea on the second day of their four-day cricket match on Saturday.</p>
</text>
